{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! How have you been? I just got done submitting my recent screenplay to a film contest just to see how others might like it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-76b9c2083807b7539141bfff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:00:50.857761+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "76b9c2083807b7539141bfff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "76b9c2083807b7539141bfff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's really cool Joanna! I hope it does well, and I've been doing great! The gaming party was a great success! We even played some Chess afterward just for fun."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-3827cc2dd07439b5cd20e30c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:00:54.970370+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3827cc2dd07439b5cd20e30c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3827cc2dd07439b5cd20e30c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Nice! Did your friends like the controller accessories?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-ebefaabe2ab27fcc526093f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:00:59.109306+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ebefaabe2ab27fcc526093f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ebefaabe2ab27fcc526093f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Most of them did! I can't say if all of them will continue to use them or not, but that's beside the point."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-b9481c80a2b483b870cda956", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:03.220353+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9481c80a2b483b870cda956", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9481c80a2b483b870cda956", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah Nate, you're right. It doesn't matter if they use it, its the thought that matters right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-fca22e4fe87f1d9910c3653c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:07.332336+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fca22e4fe87f1d9910c3653c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fca22e4fe87f1d9910c3653c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Absolutely! There were 7 people that attended, and 6 of them said they'd want to do it again next month!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-c816cc2ab7c9c2622ecbd9d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:11.456253+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c816cc2ab7c9c2622ecbd9d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c816cc2ab7c9c2622ecbd9d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That sounds like a huge success then! Congrats!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-7b358d44a6e4194fd6a34746", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:15.605828+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7b358d44a6e4194fd6a34746", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7b358d44a6e4194fd6a34746", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks! On another note, I made vegan ice cream last Friday and shared it with some people in my vegan diet group. It was awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-2d5fb1f5c8e6e042b2b59dbf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:19.737851+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2d5fb1f5c8e6e042b2b59dbf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2d5fb1f5c8e6e042b2b59dbf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Mm, yum! Can you give me the recipe for that? It sounds like it'd be a good recipe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-caceb6351300db571d780619", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:23.858650+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "caceb6351300db571d780619", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "caceb6351300db571d780619", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Sure thing! I can give it to you tomorrow, how does that sound?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-b08ab04b0675045455a5b7cd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:27.965284+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b08ab04b0675045455a5b7cd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b08ab04b0675045455a5b7cd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Awesome! I'm going to make it for my family this weekend - can't wait!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-7f22936ecebfe670aa5c7c43", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:32.056217+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7f22936ecebfe670aa5c7c43", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7f22936ecebfe670aa5c7c43", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Nice one, Joanna! Hope you and your family like it. Let me know how it went!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-b83f6775a20b9f803171ee82", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:36.146283+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b83f6775a20b9f803171ee82", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b83f6775a20b9f803171ee82", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Sure thing! They love it when I make them new things!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-5730acd55737e1b04f957e2f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:40.246556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5730acd55737e1b04f957e2f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5730acd55737e1b04f957e2f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Then I have no doubt they'll love the icecream!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-09c20d1c847145f961a84683", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:44.364755+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "09c20d1c847145f961a84683", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "09c20d1c847145f961a84683", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! Your support is greatly appreciated. I'll make sure to keep you updated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-3781fdb5a5037eaadafa560f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:48.485695+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3781fdb5a5037eaadafa560f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3781fdb5a5037eaadafa560f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Can't wait to hear about it. Have a great day! Take care."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R3-locomo-conv-42/session_16-ae24c6840b0dc95b1b0a6507", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:01:52.562286+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ae24c6840b0dc95b1b0a6507", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ae24c6840b0dc95b1b0a6507", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
